-------------------------------------------------------------------
Wed Nov 18 20:48:38 UTC 2026 - Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>

- chrome-sandbox ships setuid 4755. %verify(not mode) alone kept the
  buildroot mode, and the %install chmod 0755 in four recipes forced it
  back down, so the packaged helper was not setuid. %attr(4755, root,
  root) together with %verify(not mode) sets the packaged mode and still
  tolerates the install-time %post downgrade to 0755 on userns hosts.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Wed Nov 18 20:26:26 UTC 2026 - Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>

- Ship the payload's chrome-sandbox and Electron license files. The
  %exclude lines removed them from the file list entirely, so the RPM
  carried no setuid sandbox helper and no LICENSE.electron.txt /
  LICENSES.chromium.html. The 4755 entry now precedes the directory
  entry it duplicates.

