Sat Nov 14 08:13:36 UTC 2026 - Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>

- version 0.83.5-0
- %install: strip the payload's resources/app-update.yml and resources/package-type
  before packaging. The find line had landed after the %files file list, where rpm
  reads it as a file path and aborts with "File must begin with /", so the package
  could not be rebuilt at all.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Wed Oct 28 16:34:14 UTC 2026 - Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>

- The shipped binary talks to org.freedesktop.portal.* (file chooser,
  screen share), but no portal frontend was declared, so those
  features fail with "No such interface" on a minimal install.
  Add weak Recommends on xdg-desktop-portal and
  xdg-desktop-portal-gtk - never a hard dependency on a desktop
  stack.

Wed Oct 28 05:53:58 UTC 2026 - Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>

- Declare libpulse.so.0 and libpipewire-0.3.so.0: the bundled libcef.so
  references both for audio output and the payload is excluded from
  automatic dependency generation.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Tue Oct 20 21:00:48 UTC 2026 - Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>

- Fix macro-in-comment: reword the %license mention in the %install
  comment so rpmlint no longer expands it.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Tue Oct 20 05:54:31 UTC 2026 - Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>

- Declare libgcc_s.so.1 + libstdc++.so.6: the payload is installed under
  the auto-requires-excluded /opt/koharu path and both the main koharu
  ELF and the CEF libs DT_NEEDED them (readelf -d on the published
  0.83.5 payload; rpm -qpR had neither, so a minimal system could install
  but fail to load the app). Debian control synced (+libgcc-s1
  +libstdc++6).

Tue Oct 13 18:30:08 UTC 2026 - Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>

- Move CEF bundle from /usr/share/koharu to /opt/koharu (repo convention
  for prebuilt Electron/CEF apps): ELFs under /usr/share trip rpmlint
  E: arch-dependent-file-in-usr-share and aborted the TW build (badness
  3542). Launcher is now a /usr/bin/koharu symlink to /opt/koharu/koharu.
- Ship upstream LICENSE-MIT/LICENSE-APACHE as %license.
- rpmlintrc: drop unused missing-hash-section/shared-library-not-executable
  filters (E: unused-rpmlintrc-filter), add filelist-forbidden-opt.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
